{"seq":4,"slug":"message-queues","title":"消息队列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/storage-and-databases/message-queues","wordCount":883,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"消息队列\">消息队列</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>消息队列是分布式系统中实现异步通信的核心基础设施，它把消息的生产者与消费者解耦，使两端可以独立扩展、独立部署、独立故障。本篇的几个基础概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三大价值</strong>：解耦（生产者不需要知道消费者）、异步（生产者无需等待结果）、削峰（缓冲突发流量保护下游）。</li>\n<li><strong>传递模式</strong>：点对点（每条消息只被一个消费者处理）、发布-订阅（所有订阅者都收到）、消费者组（Kafka 结合两者优点）。</li>\n<li><strong>投递语义</strong>：At-Most-Once（可能丢失）、At-Least-Once（可能重复，最常用，配合消费端幂等）、Exactly-Once（最难，Kafka 用幂等生产者 + 事务实现）。</li>\n<li><strong>产品选型</strong>：Kafka（百万级吞吐、按时间保留可回溯）、RabbitMQ（微秒级延迟、任务分发）、SQS（全托管、零运维）。</li>\n<li><strong>代价</strong>：消息队列引入最终一致性——必须在设计中明确处理消息重复与乱序。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要消息队列\">为什么需要消息队列</h2><p>消息队列（Message Queue）是分布式系统中实现异步通信的核心基础设施。它将消息的生产者和消费者解耦，使得两端可以独立扩展、独立部署、独立故障。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;同步调用&quot;&#10;        A1[用户注册] --&gt;|同步| B1[发送邮件]&#10;        B1 --&gt;|同步| C1[发送短信]&#10;        C1 --&gt;|同步| D1[初始化账户]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;异步消息队列&quot;&#10;        A2[用户注册] --&gt;|发消息| MQ[消息队列]&#10;        MQ --&gt; B2[邮件服务]&#10;        MQ --&gt; C2[短信服务]&#10;        MQ --&gt; D2[账户服务]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"同步调用\"\n        A1[用户注册] --&gt;|同步| B1[发送邮件]\n        B1 --&gt;|同步| C1[发送短信]\n        C1 --&gt;|同步| D1[初始化账户]\n    end\n    subgraph \"异步消息队列\"\n        A2[用户注册] --&gt;|发消息| MQ[消息队列]\n        MQ --&gt; B2[邮件服务]\n        MQ --&gt; C2[短信服务]\n        MQ --&gt; D2[账户服务]\n    end</pre><p>消息队列的三大核心价值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>价值</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解耦</td>\n<td>生产者不需要知道消费者的存在</td>\n<td>订单服务 → 库存/物流/通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步</td>\n<td>生产者无需等待消费结果</td>\n<td>用户注册后异步发送欢迎邮件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>削峰</td>\n<td>缓冲突发流量，保护下游系统</td>\n<td>秒杀活动中缓冲订单请求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"消息传递模式\">消息传递模式</h2><h3 id=\"点对点-queue\">点对点（Queue）</h3><p>每条消息只被一个消费者处理：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    P1[生产者 1] --&gt; Q[队列]&#10;    P2[生产者 2] --&gt; Q&#10;    Q --&gt; C1[消费者 1]&#10;    Q --&gt; C2[消费者 2]&#10;    Q --&gt; C3[消费者 3]\">flowchart LR\n    P1[生产者 1] --&gt; Q[队列]\n    P2[生产者 2] --&gt; Q\n    Q --&gt; C1[消费者 1]\n    Q --&gt; C2[消费者 2]\n    Q --&gt; C3[消费者 3]</pre><h3 id=\"发布-订阅-pub-sub\">发布-订阅（Pub/Sub）</h3><p>每条消息被所有订阅者接收：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    P[生产者] --&gt; T[主题 Topic]&#10;    T --&gt; S1[&quot;订阅者 1&lt;br/&gt;邮件服务&quot;]&#10;    T --&gt; S2[&quot;订阅者 2&lt;br/&gt;推送服务&quot;]&#10;    T --&gt; S3[&quot;订阅者 3&lt;br/&gt;分析服务&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    P[生产者] --&gt; T[主题 Topic]\n    T --&gt; S1[\"订阅者 1&lt;br/&gt;邮件服务\"]\n    T --&gt; S2[\"订阅者 2&lt;br/&gt;推送服务\"]\n    T --&gt; S3[\"订阅者 3&lt;br/&gt;分析服务\"]</pre><h3 id=\"消费者组\">消费者组</h3><p>Kafka 的消费者组模型结合了两种模式的优点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    P[生产者] --&gt; Topic[&quot;Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 0 | Partition 1 | Partition 2&quot;]&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;消费者组 A 订单处理&quot;&#10;        A1[&quot;Consumer A1&lt;br/&gt;Partition 0&quot;]&#10;        A2[&quot;Consumer A2&lt;br/&gt;Partition 1&quot;]&#10;        A3[&quot;Consumer A3&lt;br/&gt;Partition 2&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;消费者组 B 数据分析&quot;&#10;        B1[&quot;Consumer B1&lt;br/&gt;Partition 0,1&quot;]&#10;        B2[&quot;Consumer B2&lt;br/&gt;Partition 2&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    Topic --&gt; A1&#10;    Topic --&gt; A2&#10;    Topic --&gt; A3&#10;    Topic --&gt; B1&#10;    Topic --&gt; B2\">flowchart TB\n    P[生产者] --&gt; Topic[\"Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 0 | Partition 1 | Partition 2\"]\n\n    subgraph \"消费者组 A 订单处理\"\n        A1[\"Consumer A1&lt;br/&gt;Partition 0\"]\n        A2[\"Consumer A2&lt;br/&gt;Partition 1\"]\n        A3[\"Consumer A3&lt;br/&gt;Partition 2\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"消费者组 B 数据分析\"\n        B1[\"Consumer B1&lt;br/&gt;Partition 0,1\"]\n        B2[\"Consumer B2&lt;br/&gt;Partition 2\"]\n    end\n\n    Topic --&gt; A1\n    Topic --&gt; A2\n    Topic --&gt; A3\n    Topic --&gt; B1\n    Topic --&gt; B2</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"消息投递语义\">消息投递语义</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>At-Most-Once</td>\n<td>消息最多投递一次，可能丢失</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>日志、监控指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>At-Least-Once</td>\n<td>消息至少投递一次，可能重复</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大多数业务场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exactly-Once</td>\n<td>消息恰好投递一次</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>金融交易、计费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Exactly-Once 是最难实现的语义。Kafka 通过幂等生产者 + 事务来实现端到端的 Exactly-Once：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface IdempotentConsumer {&#10;  processedIds: Set&lt;string&gt;;&#10;&#10;  async handle(message: Message): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Message {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  topic: string;&#10;  payload: unknown;&#10;  timestamp: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class OrderConsumer implements IdempotentConsumer {&#10;  processedIds = new Set&lt;string&gt;();&#10;&#10;  async handle(message: Message): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    if (this.processedIds.has(message.id)) {&#10;      return;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    await this.processOrder(message.payload as Order);&#10;    this.processedIds.add(message.id);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private async processOrder(order: Order): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    // ...&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Order {&#10;  orderId: string;&#10;  userId: string;&#10;  amount: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IdempotentConsumer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  processedIds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  topic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderConsumer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IdempotentConsumer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  processedIds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.processedIds.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(message.id)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">processOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(message.payload </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.processedIds.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(message.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"主流消息队列对比\">主流消息队列对比</h2><h3 id=\"kafka\">Kafka</h3><p>Apache Kafka 是一个分布式流处理平台，以其极高的吞吐量和可靠的持久化著称：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Producer[生产者] --&gt; Broker1[Broker 1]&#10;    Producer --&gt; Broker2[Broker 2]&#10;    Producer --&gt; Broker3[Broker 3]&#10;&#10;    subgraph Broker1[Broker 1]&#10;        P0_L[Topic-A Partition 0&lt;br/&gt;Leader]&#10;        P1_F[Topic-A Partition 1&lt;br/&gt;Follower]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Broker2[Broker 2]&#10;        P0_F[Topic-A Partition 0&lt;br/&gt;Follower]&#10;        P1_L[Topic-A Partition 1&lt;br/&gt;Leader]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Broker3[Broker 3]&#10;        P0_F2[Topic-A Partition 0&lt;br/&gt;Follower]&#10;        P1_F2[Topic-A Partition 1&lt;br/&gt;Follower]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    Producer[生产者] --&gt; Broker1[Broker 1]\n    Producer --&gt; Broker2[Broker 2]\n    Producer --&gt; Broker3[Broker 3]\n\n    subgraph Broker1[Broker 1]\n        P0_L[Topic-A Partition 0&lt;br/&gt;Leader]\n        P1_F[Topic-A Partition 1&lt;br/&gt;Follower]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Broker2[Broker 2]\n        P0_F[Topic-A Partition 0&lt;br/&gt;Follower]\n        P1_L[Topic-A Partition 1&lt;br/&gt;Leader]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Broker3[Broker 3]\n        P0_F2[Topic-A Partition 0&lt;br/&gt;Follower]\n        P1_F2[Topic-A Partition 1&lt;br/&gt;Follower]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"rabbitmq-vs-kafka-vs-sqs\">RabbitMQ vs Kafka vs SQS</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>RabbitMQ</th>\n<th>Kafka</th>\n<th>Amazon SQS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模型</td>\n<td>消息队列</td>\n<td>分布式日志</td>\n<td>托管消息队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吞吐量</td>\n<td>万级 msg/s</td>\n<td>百万级 msg/s</td>\n<td>取决于配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息保留</td>\n<td>消费后删除</td>\n<td>按时间保留（可回溯）</td>\n<td>最多 14 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费模式</td>\n<td>Push（推送）</td>\n<td>Pull（拉取）</td>\n<td>Pull（拉取）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息顺序</td>\n<td>队列内有序</td>\n<td>分区内有序</td>\n<td>FIFO 队列可保序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>微秒级</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维复杂度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>零（全托管）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>任务分发、RPC</td>\n<td>事件流、日志收集</td>\n<td>云原生微服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用架构\">实际应用架构</h2><h3 id=\"电商订单流\">电商订单流</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    User[用户下单] --&gt; OrderSvc[订单服务]&#10;    OrderSvc --&gt; OrderTopic[订单事件 Topic]&#10;&#10;    OrderTopic --&gt; Inventory[库存服务&lt;br/&gt;扣减库存]&#10;    OrderTopic --&gt; Payment[支付服务&lt;br/&gt;发起支付]&#10;    OrderTopic --&gt; Notification[通知服务&lt;br/&gt;发送确认]&#10;    OrderTopic --&gt; Analytics[分析服务&lt;br/&gt;记录指标]&#10;&#10;    Payment --&gt; PaymentTopic[支付事件 Topic]&#10;    PaymentTopic --&gt; Shipping[物流服务&lt;br/&gt;创建运单]&#10;    PaymentTopic --&gt; Notification\">flowchart TB\n    User[用户下单] --&gt; OrderSvc[订单服务]\n    OrderSvc --&gt; OrderTopic[订单事件 Topic]\n\n    OrderTopic --&gt; Inventory[库存服务&lt;br/&gt;扣减库存]\n    OrderTopic --&gt; Payment[支付服务&lt;br/&gt;发起支付]\n    OrderTopic --&gt; Notification[通知服务&lt;br/&gt;发送确认]\n    OrderTopic --&gt; Analytics[分析服务&lt;br/&gt;记录指标]\n\n    Payment --&gt; PaymentTopic[支付事件 Topic]\n    PaymentTopic --&gt; Shipping[物流服务&lt;br/&gt;创建运单]\n    PaymentTopic --&gt; Notification</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface OrderEvent {&#10;  eventId: string;&#10;  t