span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crypto.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">randomUUID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((消息队列))&#10;    核心价值&#10;      解耦 生产者消费者独立&#10;      异步 非阻塞处理&#10;      削峰 缓冲突发流量&#10;    消息模式&#10;      点对点 Queue&#10;      发布订阅 Pub/Sub&#10;      消费者组&#10;    投递语义&#10;      At-Most-Once 可能丢失&#10;      At-Least-Once 可能重复&#10;      Exactly-Once 最难实现&#10;    产品选型&#10;      Kafka 高吞吐 事件流&#10;      RabbitMQ 低延迟 任务分发&#10;      SQS 全托管 云原生\">mindmap\n  root((消息队列))\n    核心价值\n      解耦 生产者消费者独立\n      异步 非阻塞处理\n      削峰 缓冲突发流量\n    消息模式\n      点对点 Queue\n      发布订阅 Pub/Sub\n      消费者组\n    投递语义\n      At-Most-Once 可能丢失\n      At-Least-Once 可能重复\n      Exactly-Once 最难实现\n    产品选型\n      Kafka 高吞吐 事件流\n      RabbitMQ 低延迟 任务分发\n      SQS 全托管 云原生</pre><ul>\n<li>消息队列的三大价值：<strong>解耦、异步、削峰</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>At-Least-Once</strong> 是最常用的投递语义，配合消费者幂等实现可靠处理。</li>\n<li><strong>Kafka</strong> 适合高吞吐量的事件流和日志场景。</li>\n<li><strong>RabbitMQ</strong> 适合低延迟的任务分发和 RPC 场景。</li>\n<li>消息队列引入了<strong>最终一致性</strong>——需要在系统设计中明确处理消息重复和乱序的问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"消息队列","id":"消息队列"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要消息队列","id":"为什么需要消息队列"},{"level":2,"text":"消息传递模式","id":"消息传递模式"},{"level":3,"text":"点对点（Queue）","id":"点对点-queue"},{"level":3,"text":"发布-订阅（Pub/Sub）","id":"发布-订阅-pub-sub"},{"level":3,"text":"消费者组","id":"消费者组"},{"level":2,"text":"消息投递语义","id":"消息投递语义"},{"level":2,"text":"主流消息队列对比","id":"主流消息队列对比"},{"level":3,"text":"Kafka","id":"kafka"},{"level":3,"text":"RabbitMQ vs Kafka vs SQS","id":"rabbitmq-vs-kafka-vs-sqs"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用架构","id":"实际应用架构"},{"level":3,"text":"电商订单流","id":"电商订单流"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"缓存策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/storage-and-databases/caching-strategies"},"next":{"title":"负载均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/distributed-systems/load-balancing"}}